-in</b></div></li></ol></div><h3 class="gd-h3">If something goes wrong</h3><div class="gd-tablewrap"><table class="gd-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">What you see</th><th scope="col">What to do</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b class="gd-ui">A link says it expired</b></td><td>Links in our emails work for 24 hours, once. Press <b class="gd-ui">Send me a new link</b> on that page.</td></tr><tr><td><b class="gd-ui">&quot;Error 1102&quot; on a page</b></td><td>A short limit on our web host. Reload the page. You are still signed in.</td></tr><tr><td><b class="gd-ui">&quot;That email and password do not match an account.&quot;</b></td><td>Check the address, or use <b class="gd-ui">Set a new password</b> on the sign-in page.</td></tr><tr><td><b class="gd-ui">Asked for a 6-digit code</b></td><td>Open your authenticator app. Lost your phone? Call us.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><ul class="gd-ul"><li><b class="gd-ui">Search:</b> the <b class="gd-ui">Search</b> button at the top of every page finds the portal&#39;s pages and the site&#39;s.</li></ul>');
